a-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading40_c00042\">We work directly with farming families in the Central Highlands and the Northwest, picking only ripe cherries, processing them with care and roasting in small batches to keep the true character of each region.</p>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/advancedbtn {\"mhAlign\":\"center\",\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00043\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns40_c00043\"><!-- wp:kadence/singlebtn {\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00044\",\"text\":\"View products\",\"link\":\"/cua-hang/\",\"sizePreset\":\"large\",\"color\":\"palette1\",\"background\":\"palette9\",\"colorHover\":\"palette9\",\"backgroundHover\":\"palette2\",\"inheritStyles\":\"inherit\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedbtn --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/rowlayout -->','Home','','private','closed','closed','','home-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:53','2026-09-29 10:04:53','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=470',0,'page','',0),(471,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:53','2026-09-29 10:04:53','','Shop','','private','closed','closed','','cua-hang-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:53','2026-09-29 10:04:53','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=471',0,'page','',0),(472,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[woocommerce_cart]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Cart','','private','closed','closed','','gio-hang-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=472',0,'page','',0),(473,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[woocommerce_checkout]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','Checkout','','private','closed','closed','','thanh-toan-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=473',0,'page','',0),(474,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cà Phê Mộc</strong><br>Address: 12 Lê Duẩn, Phường Buôn Ma Thuột, Tỉnh Đắk Lắk<br>Phone: 0900 000 000<br>Opening hours: 8:00 – 20:00 daily</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<iframe title=\"Map of Cà Phê Mộc\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=12%20L%C3%AA%20Du%E1%BA%A9n%2C%20Ph%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng%20Bu%C3%B4n%20Ma%20Thu%E1%BB%99t%2C%20T%E1%BB%89nh%20%C4%90%E1%BA%AFk%20L%E1%BA%AFk&amp;output=embed\" width=\"100%\" height=\"380\" style=\"border:0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Contact','','private','closed','closed','','lien-he-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=474',0,'page','',0),(475,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We deliver nationwide through our shipping partners within 2–5 business days, depending on your area.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shipping is a flat 30.000đ. Orders from 500.000đ ship free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You pay in cash when your order arrives (COD).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Shipping policy','','private','closed','closed','','chinh-sach-giao-hang-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=475',0,'page','',0),(476,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Free exchange within 7 days if the product is defective, the wrong type, or the packaging was damaged in transit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please keep the original packaging and call 0900 000 000 for support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Return policy','','private','closed','closed','','chinh-sach-doi-tra-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=476',0,'page','',0),(477,0,'2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We only use your name, phone number and address to deliver and look after your orders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your information is never shared with third parties other than our shipping partners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy policy','','private','closed','closed','','chinh-sach-bao-mat-en','','','2026-09-29 17:04:54','2026-09-29 10:04:54','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=477',0,'page','',0),(481,0,'2026-09-29 17:44:43','2026-09-29 10:44:43','<!-- wp:kadence/rowlayout {\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00008\",\"tabletLayout\":\"row\",\"columnGutter\":\"custom\",\"customGutter\":[40,\"\",\"\"],\"colLayout\":\"equal\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"middle\",\"inheritMaxWidth\":true,\"padding\":[80,\"\",80,\"\"],\"mobilePadding\":[40,\"\",48,\"\"],\"kbVersion\":2,\"className\":\"cafe-hero\"} -->\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00006\",\"kbVersion\":2,\"className\":\"inner-column-1\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column40_c00006 inner-column-1\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:kadence/advancedheading {\"level\":6,\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00001\",\"color\":\"palette2\",\"markBorder\":\"\",\"markBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"tabletMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"mobileMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"colorClass\":\"theme-palette2\"} -->\n<h6 class=\"kt-adv-heading40_c00001 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-2-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading40_c00001\">Rang xay mỗi tuần</h6>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/advancedheading {\"level\":1,\"uniqueID\":\"40_c00002\",\"color\":\"palette3\",\"markBorder\":\"\",\"markBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\